message: "If you use skills from this library in research or program work, please cite the specific skill and version (see docs/citing.md). To cite the library as a whole, use the metadata below."
title: "Behavioral Science Skills Library"
type: software
authors:
  - name: "The Agency Fund"
  - name: "Irrational Labs"
repository-code: "https://github.com/agency-fund/besci-skills"
