abstract: "An open-source library of atomic AI skills that bring actionable behavioral-science methods into everyday work. Skill content is CC BY 4.0 and code is MIT. Each skill is a versioned, cited procedure with a trigger rule, an output template, known failure modes, an escalation point, and test cases."
